  "schema:name": "Column structure of the CDAWeb HAPI CSV response for MMS4_HPCA_BRST_L2_ION (DDI-CDI WideDataStructure)",
  "schema:description": "Authoritative column layout of the HAPI CSV, derived from https://cdaweb.gsfc.nasa.gov/hapi/info?id=MMS4_HPCA_BRST_L2_ION . This is a DIFFERENT and larger parameter set than the CDF granules: it omits the CDF support/time-angle variables and adds derived flux variants (_movie, _byE_atAnode, _byAnode_atE) and housekeeping. One component per HAPI parameter, in order; array parameters ([16,63] or [4]) are flattened to that many consecutive CSV columns (cdif:columnSpan), so the CSV has 32274 columns total and no header row. Components whose name matches a CDF variable reference the dataset's InstanceVariable by @id.",
  "dcterms:conformsTo": [
    {
      "@id": "https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.1"
    }
  ],
